    <briefdescription>
<para>Type storing dependency information for one data item. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A task dependency (<computeroutput><ref refid="classcuda_1_1experimental_1_1stf_1_1task__dep" kindref="compound">task_dep</ref></computeroutput>) object stores a pointer to the logical data, the requested access mode, and other requirements such as the data placement policy.</para>
<para>Note that the instance id is set automatically when the systems assigns an id for this specific instance of data. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
